  "resolution_html": "<p>To report a suspicious email, click on the <strong>More apps</strong> icon</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-27-47-PM.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report Phishing</strong> button</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-28-13-PM.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder</strong></p>",
